New store/archive-hotkey.ts registry + ctx.registerArchiveHotkeyHandler: a
handler claims the target session (e.g. an Inbox message, hidden from the
sidebar and maybe on another gateway), archives it its own way and picks the
next one; openNextSession() falls back to core's next-sidebar step. Unclaimed
sessions archive through archiveSession as before. Tests: archive-hotkey.test.ts.
